Talea
=====

Talea is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your option) any later
version. The licence text is in LICENSE.

Talea is a hard fork of Kaleta, the open-source CMS by Miroslav Kaleta (GitHub: phprscms) and
contributors: https://kaletacms.com, source at https://github.com/phprs-cms/kaletacms.
Talea branched off at Kaleta 3.7.0 in October 2026. It diverges deliberately and merges nothing from
upstream; later Kaleta changes are re-implemented, not copied. What differs: README.md ("What Talea
changes") and docs/DECISIONS.md.

Original work: Copyright (C) Miroslav Kaleta and the contributors of Kaleta (committed as
"Miroslav Kaleta" and "KaletaCMS" in the project history, which this repository keeps).
Changes made in this fork: Copyright (C) Christian Zepter and the contributors of Talea.

Bundled third-party software keeps its own licence: Bricolage Grotesque (image/fonts/OFL.txt,
SIL Open Font License 1.1) and the libraries under image/vendor and vendor/.

Font library: the families in image/fonts/<family>/ (about 28 open-source families from the Google Fonts repository,
https://github.com/google/fonts, subset to Latin and Latin-extended and converted to WOFF2) are licensed under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1. Each folder carries its own OFL.txt with the copyright holders and any Reserved Font Name, and a font.json
with the source address; the licence texts must stay with the files. See docs/FONTS.md.
